{
  "rules": [
    "This is a Next.js 15+ App Router application with React 19, Tailwind CSS v4, and a pure PHP 8.x + MySQL backend under public/api/.",
    "Read AGENTS.md before making any architectural or structural changes.",
    "The frontend compiles via static export (output: 'export' in next.config.ts) for cPanel deployment in public_html.",
    "Do NOT add Node.js server routes under app/api/; all backend logic lives in public/api/*.php.",
    "Do NOT add fake local database emulation layers or mock fallbacks; communicate directly with PHP endpoints.",
    "Ensure all code blocks, tables, and terminal snippets remain LTR with 'font-mono', while Persian text retains RTL orientation.",
    "When adding new Lucide icons, use named imports from 'lucide-react' directly.",
    "When adding animations, import from 'motion/react'."
  ]
}
